  invariant the carrier ladder is descended, never skipped: push, then federation,
    then a feed, then a source index, then structured metadata, then a conditional
    fetch, and only then the page and a model
  invariant every inbound body is admitted by the organ that owns foreign
    observation, and parsed only while it still hashes to its receipt
  invariant outbound artifacts are materialized once and read many times, so ten
    thousand machine consumers cost approximately what one costs
  invariant a source that declines -- by robots, by challenge, or by publishing
    nothing machine-legible -- is recorded as declining and respected
  invariant a public MCP, A2A, OAuth, OpenID, auth.md, App Link, or similar descriptor is
    retained only as a CUE-bounded declared candidate in a source passport; it
    cannot become a live endpoint, admitted provider, credential, payment route,
    identity assertion, or effect right without the later native owners
  invariant public membrane surfaces expose aggregate coverage only; foreign roots,
    reader-family detail, and declared descriptor coordinates require the separate
    Bonfyre admin closure and remain no-store/noindex there
  witness tests/foreign_discover_protocol_test.py.archive is the retired Python loopback witness; active Bun witnesses now cover its descriptor contract without a live Python test runner
    descriptor-shaped JSON becomes declared_descriptor passport candidates only,
    leaves the carrier ladder on its ordinary cheapest path, and asserts no
    provider/authority/effect state
  witness cmd/BonfyreWebAddress/tests/auth_surface_test.sh proves an anonymous
    membrane view cannot enumerate a fixture foreign root or reader family while
    the current bonfyre/admin closure can inspect that retained operational detail
    and its declared MCP descriptor candidate
  forbidden_inference machine reach -> audience; a projection consumed by a
    crawler is a representation delivered, not a person informed
  forbidden_inference a passport or a reader row -> a claim about the world; one
    records how a source publishes, the other that a request arrived carrying a
    declared identity
  source_lineage Machine membrane, both directions, 2026-08-30
